KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Day 23 was focused on revision and reinforcement.

Major Realizations:

- Revision improves retention.
- Strong fundamentals are built through repetition.
- Understanding concepts deeply is more important than rushing through topics.
- Consistency creates long-term progress.

Today was not about learning something new.

It was about strengthening what has already been learned and preparing for the next stage of growth.